  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n5(5)/({29)} - [ {frac{{15}}{4} ÷ left{ {(3)/(4) × ( {(3)/(2) - (1)/(5) - (1)/(3)} )} right}} ]\n\n⇒ 150/29 – [15/4 ÷ {3/4 × (3/2 – 1/5 – 1/3)}]\n\n⇒ 150/29 – [15/4 ÷ {3/4 × (45 – 6 – 10)/30}]\n\n⇒ 150/29 – [15/4 ÷ {3/4 × 29/30}]\n\n⇒ 150/29 – [15/4 ÷ (29/40)]\n\n⇒ 150/29 – [15/4 × 40/29]\n\n⇒ 150/29 – 150/29\n\n⇒ 0\n\n**∴ The required value is 0**",
